  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Mediation Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Humanitarian Mediation Initiative is a violence prevention model that supports communities to reduce their vulnerability and risk through proactive mediation processes. The overall objective of the Humanitarian Mediation Initiative (HMI) project is to &#x201c;contribute to improved protection of civilians in Central African Republic (CAR), Mali and Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC) through emergency mediation processes aiming at conflict prevention and mitigation.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
